    "en": {
      "text": "Elemental Kills grant 1 Stack of Recombination even while the weapon is stowed. Maximum of <enhanced/>${10/#d} stacks.\n\nEach Stack additively increases the damage of the next shot by #e<pve ${10*#d}% /> #e<pvp [${5*#d}%] />, up to <pve 100% /> <pvp [50%] /> at #e${10/#d} stacks.\n\nenhanced (\nvar d = 1.25\n<enhanced/> Damage Buff ramps up 25% faster, reaching maximum strength 2 stacks sooner.\n)",
